<title>USA: SOCCER-PERU BEATS UNITED STATES IN U.S. CUP TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PERU BEATS UNITED STATES IN U.S. CUP TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru defeated the United</p>
<p>States 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in the opening match of the U.S. Cup</p>
<p>soccer tournament Friday at Jack Murphy Stadium.</p>
<p>Peru - German Carty (8th minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000 (estimated)</p>
</text>
